    "committer": "GitHub <noreply@github.com>",
    "message": "Replace inefficient patterns (#10)\n\n* Use startsWith() instead of substr()\n\nmicrobenchmark::microbenchmark(file.path(\"a\", \"b\"), paste0(\"a\", \"/\", \"b\"), times = 1e4)\n#> Unit: nanoseconds\n#>                   expr min  lq     mean median   uq    max neval\n#>    file.path(\"a\", \"b\") 574 639 1022.293    677  763  84528 10000\n#>  paste0(\"a\", \"/\", \"b\") 848 943 1403.952   1009 1111 170456 10000\n\n* Use !nzchar() instead of == \"\"\n\nmicrobenchmark::microbenchmark(\"test/test/test/test\" == \"\", !nzchar(\"test/test/test/test\"), times = 1e4)\n#> Unit: nanoseconds\n#>                            expr min lq    mean median uq  max neval\n#>     \"test/test/test/test\" == \"\"  60 68 91.1651     74 79 5723 10000\n#>  !nzchar(\"test/test/test/test\")  51 58 80.0586     61 70 9719 10000\n\n* Use file.path() consistently\n\nmicrobenchmark::microbenchmark(paste0(\"group\", \"/data\"), paste0(\"group\", \"/\", \"data\"), file.path(\"group\", \"data\"), times = 1e5)\n#> Unit: nanoseconds\n#>                          expr min  lq      mean median   uq     max neval\n#>      paste0(\"group\", \"/data\") 786 874 1026.1339    902  957 2266881 1e+05\n#>  paste0(\"group\", \"/\", \"data\") 871 968 1151.3651   1000 1081 1589845 1e+05\n#>    file.path(\"group\", \"data\") 590 655  786.3354    678  734 1586759 1e+05\n\n* Use dim() <- NULL instead of as.vector()\n\nx <- sample(1:1e7, 1e7, replace = TRUE)\ndim(x) <- 1e7\n\nbench::mark(\n  as.vector(x),\n  as.integer(x),\n  # We assign to y here for benchmarking purposes. To avoid removing dim for our test object after the first iteration.\n  {\n    y <- x\n    dim(y) <- NULL\n    y\n  },\n  iterations = 1000\n)\n#> # A tibble: 3 \u00d7 6\n#>   expression                       min   median `\nitr/sec` mem_alloc\n`\ngc/sec`\n#>   <bch:expr>                  <bch:tm> <bch:tm>     <dbl> <bch:byt>    <dbl>\n#> 1 as.vector(x)                  11.5ms   12.3ms      81.3    38.1MB     25.3\n#> 2 as.integer(x)                 11.5ms   12.3ms      81.2    38.1MB     20.3\n#> 3 { y <- x dim(y) <- NULL y }    326ns    359ns 2545301.         0B ",
    "time": 1784653511
